#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:1 391d11eb902341fcb93ab1e5f5a202bc
msgid "可视化"
msgstr "Visualization"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:3 42861c9cf46b4612b3f73dbafe962e49
msgid "画布是右侧的 Three.js 3D 视图（会合系，质心归一化坐标），展示族生成结果与 轨道库叠加轨迹。"
msgstr "The canvas is the Three.js 3D view on the right (synodic frame, barycentric normalized coordinates), showing generated families and overlaid catalog trajectories."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:6 89f222bd5c87445e946a0669831e3ad2
msgid "交互"
msgstr "Interaction"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:8 944abf6c8c2d46ac87ccd14e813fafae
msgid "**左键拖拽**：旋转视角；**滚轮**：缩放；**右键拖拽**：平移。"
msgstr "**Left-drag**: rotate; **wheel**: zoom; **right-drag**: pan."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:9 2559207a33bb45e1aa3bc10ed67418c0
msgid "**适配**（右上角按钮）：按当前轨迹的包围盒重设相机，每侧留 5% 余量。"
msgstr "**Fit** (top-right button): recentres the camera on the current trajectories' bounding box with a 5% margin on each side."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:10 0e769570de284b41991d4cc4ee9391f5
msgid "**视图保持**：首次数据到达时自动适配一次；此后增删轨迹不重置相机， 手动旋转缩放的视角不被打扰（CONTEXT.md 领域语义）。"
msgstr "**View preservation**: the view auto-fits once when data first arrives; afterwards adding or removing trajectories does not reset the camera, so your manual rotate/zoom is never disturbed (domain semantics in CONTEXT.md)."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:13 b26976ad84de4b06a51bc6ca051fd4fd
msgid "标注与配色"
msgstr "Annotations and Colors"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:15 d196fe4490044629b5c5c18559789236
msgid "画布固定绘制地球、月球与 L1/L2 平动点球体及文字标注。多条轨迹按颜色循环 自动配色：族生成成员一组颜色，库叠加轨迹依次取后续颜色。"
msgstr "The canvas always draws the Earth, the Moon and the L1/L2 libration points as spheres with text labels. Multiple trajectories take colors from a cycle automatically: family members share the leading colors, and catalog overlays take the following ones."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:18 daf4912bf65c4f3fb59094ef1a0ffd59
msgid "图表设置"
msgstr "Chart Settings"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:20 22758fc00ef84526b212dbdf14775069
msgid "右上角「图表设置」打开设置面板，即时生效并持久化（localStorage），可一键 恢复默认："
msgstr "The top-right \"Chart Settings\" opens the settings panel - changes apply instantly and persist (localStorage), with one-click reset to defaults:"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:23 bdeeea46634d48beaadf3db905b065ac
msgid "轨道线宽；"
msgstr "Orbit line width;"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:24 798182a04ad8431497884a88713f362d
msgid "地球 / 月球 / 平动点标注大小、平动点颜色；"
msgstr "Earth / Moon / libration-point marker sizes, libration-point color;"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:25 1196adf300fb4815b76491a8651db13c
msgid "Z 轴比例（近平面轨道防压扁）。"
msgstr "Z-axis ratio (prevents squashing near-planar orbits)."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:27 cc3562d58479465a8cbc54ffd4b7da21
msgid "导出动画"
msgstr "Export Animation"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:29 aed8e9ae8ade41ab9d676b4f564b7454
msgid ""
"右上角「导出动画」录制 8 秒画布自转（30 fps），经浏览器 MediaRecorder 编码 为 `orbit-"
"animation.webm` 下载；不依赖外部编码器。录制期间按钮显示进度态， 结束后自动停止自转。"
msgstr "The top-right \"Export Animation\" records 8 seconds of canvas auto-rotation (30 fps), encoded by the browser's MediaRecorder into `orbit-animation.webm` for download - no external encoder needed. The button shows progress while recording; rotation stops automatically at the end."

